.TH MAPS-MQTT-REPLAY 1 "25 November 2026" "maps-apps 4.6.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
maps-mqtt-replay \- compatibility command for MQTT event replay and mesh validation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B maps-mqtt-replay
.BI --dir " directory"
.BI --broker " url"
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B maps-mqtt-replay
is a backwards-compatible command name for
.BR maps-mqtt-mesh-test (1).
Both commands execute the same application and accept the same options,
including replay acceleration, session grouping, and optional MQTT observation
points. Without
.BR --observe ,
only replay is performed.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
maps-mqtt-replay --dir /data/repmus \
  --broker tcp://127.0.0.1:1883 --speed 100
.EE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /opt/maps/apps/mqtt_mesh_test.jar
Executable JAR installed by the maps-apps Debian package.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR maps-mqtt-mesh-test (1),
.BR maps-apps (7)
.SH AUTHOR
MapsMessaging B.V.
